The ages is a list of 20, 30, 100, 110, and 120.
Keep a shared good as 0.

To test from older (a whole number) with younger (a whole number).
Set good to 0.
The lowerbound is older divided by 2 plus 7.
If younger is more than lowerbound and younger is at most older and younger is at most 100, set good to 1.
If younger is more than lowerbound and younger is at most older and older is at least 100, set good to 1.

The total is 0.
For every first from 0 to the last position of ages.
For every second from 0 to the last position of ages.
Test from item first of ages with item second of ages.
If first is not second and good is 1, add 1 to total.

Show total.
